sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant E as SummaryController<br/>(Api)
    participant S as SummaryService<br/>(Application)
    participant D as MeterReadingsDbContext<br/>(Infrastructure)
    participant K as ConsumptionSummaryCalculator<br/>(Domain)

    C->>E: GET /api/meters/2/summary?fromUtc=...&toUtc=...
    Note over E: fromUtc and toUtc are parsed to UTC.<br/>Missing, invalid, or from after to returns 400.
    E->>S: GetAsync(meterId, range)
    S->>D: does the meter exist?
    alt meter not found
        S-->>C: NotFoundException → 404
    end
    S->>D: load readings in the inclusive range
    D-->>S: readings
    S->>K: Calculate(readings, from, to)
    Note over K: Filter to range, order by timestamp
    loop each consecutive pair
        Note over K: UsageCalculator.Calculate(previous, current) → kWh<br/>Attribute to the UTC date of the later reading
    end
    Note over K: Total = latest − earliest,<br/>or the sum of pairs if the range has a reset or decrease
    K-->>S: ConsumptionSummary (total, daily)
    S-->>E: SummaryResponse
    E-->>C: 200 OK
